# README.md carries a generated screen verbatim and `test/cli/args.test.ts`
# compares the two byte for byte, so a checkout that converted it to CRLF would
# fail that compare for a reason that has nothing to do with the command line.
#
# Markdown and nothing else. `* text=auto eol=lf` was the first spelling, and
# it also normalized what a fixture captured from a subprocess: this repository
# records what three harness CLIs printed, and a fixture is evidence rather
# than text git may tidy.
*.md text eol=lf
